    <system:String x:Key="Depot.SortByProgress.Tip" xml:space="preserve">When checked, plans are queued each run in ascending inventory progress order, so the plan with the largest shortfall ratio gets sanity first.&#10;The display order of the list is unchanged; drag-and-drop ordering only takes effect when unchecked.&#10;Ordering uses the cached inventory from the last scan; each plan still recalculates its shortfall from the latest inventory when it starts.</system:String>
