    <system:String x:Key="Depot.UpdateBeforeStart">Update inventory before starting</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Depot.UpdateBeforeStart.Tip" xml:space="preserve">When the task starts, MAA first checks each plan's shortfall against the inventory data cached at that moment; this step is called the pre-check. Plans already meeting their targets are not added to this run's farming list and will not be re-evaluated afterwards.&#10;Each plan is re-checked against the latest cache when it starts, and drops from earlier stages are added to the cache in real time.&#10;When enabled, a depot recognition runs before the plans and corrects the cache to the actual inventory.&#10;If a skipped plan turns out to be insufficient after recognition, it cannot be added while running; it is only logged, and re-running the task farms it.</system:String>
