    <system:String x:Key="Depot.UseAutoSeries.Tip" xml:space="preserve">When unchecked, runs at 1×; when checked, runs at the highest series multiplier allowed by current sanity, so drops from a single run may exceed the target inventory limit.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Depot.UseExpiringMedicine">Use expiring sanity potions (within 48 hours)</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Depot.UseExpiringMedicine.Tip" xml:space="preserve">Applies to all plans, including those without a potion budget.&#10;When enabled, plans without a budget will also try to use sanity potions expiring within 48 hours.&#10;Such plans are only skipped for insufficient sanity after some fight task in this queue run has ended due to insufficient sanity, with an expiring-medicine window not smaller than this setting (i.e., potions within this window are used up).</system:String>
