    <system:String x:Key="Roguelike.BlackFlow.PrepFlight.Tip" xml:space="preserve">The preparation run always starts with Special Squad, Slow and Steady Wins the Race and your own Mechanic, recruits only the Mechanic, and flies straight from Floor 2 to Floor 3 with the built-in Structural Principle.&#10;When checked, ｢{key=Roguelike.CollectibleModeSquad}｣ shows Special Squad and cannot be changed; unchecking restores the previous setting. The roles and starting operator in General settings are not affected.&#10;Do not check this if your Mechanic's talent is not fully unlocked, as the flight will fail.</system:String>
