    <system:String x:Key="Settings.PendingFullUpdateManualConfirmDesc" xml:space="preserve">A full-package update is required.

Update flow: if you continue with downloading or importing the full package, the later install step will first clean the top-level files and folders under the current install root, except cache, config, data, debug, achievement (screenshots), and MAA.Updater.exe, and then write the full package into that directory.

Risk: if MAA was extracted directly into a drive root, Desktop, Downloads, or any shared folder with other programs or personal files, those sibling entries may also be removed or moved away.

Recommended layout: place MAA inside a dedicated folder, for example:
D:\
`-- MAA\
    |-- MAA.exe
    |-- config\
    `-- data\

Back up the entire install directory manually before continuing, especially any non-MAA files that sit next to it.
Current install directory: {0}

Continue only after you have verified the directory layout and finished a manual backup.</system:String>
